# A relayed DHCPDISCOVER of a macOS 14 client: parameter request list first, maximum
# message size 1500, client identifier type 1 with the MAC, lease time hint and host name;
# padded to 300 octets. Modelled by hand on the option order and parameter request list
# this client sends; documentation addresses (RFC 5737) and MACs (RFC 7042).
#
# op 1, htype 1, hlen 6, hops 1
01 01 06 01
# xid
a1 01 15 06
# secs, flags
00 00 00 00
# ciaddr 0.0.0.0
00 00 00 00
# yiaddr 0.0.0.0
00 00 00 00
# siaddr 0.0.0.0
00 00 00 00
# giaddr 192.0.2.1
c0 00 02 01
# chaddr
00 00 5e 00 53 15 00*10
# sname: empty
00*64
# file: empty
00*128
# magic cookie
63 82 53 63
# option 53: DHCPDISCOVER
35 01 01
# option 55: parameter request list
37 0c 01 79 03 06 0f 6c 72 77 fc 5f 2c 2e
# option 57: maximum message size 1500
39 02 05 dc
# option 61: client identifier, type 1 and the MAC
3d 07 01 00 00 5e 00 53 15
# option 51: IP address lease time 7776000 seconds
33 04 00 76 a7 00
# option 12: host name "mac-15"
0c 06 6d 61 63 2d 31 35
# end
ff
# padding to 300 octets
00*15
